# Operators with motions and text objects, registers and puts.

=== dw deletes a word and its blanks
text:
|foo bar baz
keys: dw
want:
|bar baz

=== dw on the last word stays on its line
text:
foo |bar
next
keys: dw
want:
foo| 
next

=== d2w and 2dw
text:
|a b c d
keys: d2w
want:
|c d

=== counts multiply
text:
|a b c d e f g
keys: 2d3w
want:
|g

=== de keeps the blank
text:
|foo bar
keys: de
want:
| bar

=== cw is ce
text:
|foo bar
keys: cwxy<Esc>
want:
x|y bar

=== dd and a count
text:
one
|two
three
four
keys: 2dd
want:
one
|four

=== dd on the last line
text:
one
|two
keys: dd
want:
|one

=== dj deletes two lines
text:
|one
two
three
keys: dj
want:
|three

=== d$ and D
text:
ab|cdef
keys: D
want:
a|b

=== x and a count
text:
|abcdef
keys: 3x
want:
|def

=== X deletes before
text:
abc|d
keys: X
want:
ab|d

=== dt and df
text:
|one, two, three
keys: dt,
want:
|, two, three

=== df includes the character
text:
|one, two
keys: df,
want:
| two

=== diw and daw
text:
foo b|ar baz
keys: daw
want:
foo |baz

=== ciw changes the word
text:
foo b|ar baz
keys: ciwQ<Esc>
want:
foo |Q baz

=== di( inside parentheses
text:
f(a, |b, c)
keys: di(
want:
f(|)

=== da( takes the parentheses
text:
x = f(a, (|b), c)
keys: 2da(
want:
x = |f

=== ci" inside quotes
text:
say "hel|lo" now
keys: ci"bye<Esc>
want:
say "by|e" now

=== yank and put
text:
|foo bar
keys: yiwP
want:
fo|ofoo bar

=== yy and p put a line below
text:
|one
two
keys: yyjp
want:
one
two
|one

=== P puts a line above
text:
one
|two
keys: yyP
want:
one
|two
two

=== named registers
text:
|one two
keys: "ayiwwdiw"aP
want:
oneon|e 

=== appending to a register
text:
|a b
keys: "ayiww"Ayiw$"ap
want:
a ba|b

=== the black hole keeps the unnamed register
text:
|keep drop
keys: yiww"_dawp
want:
keepkee|p

=== deleting lines fills register 1
text:
|one
two
keys: dd"1p
want:
two
|one

=== >> and <<
text:
|one
two
keys: >j
want:
	|one
	two

=== << takes a tab
text:
	|one
keys: <lt><lt>
want:
|one

=== g~ gu gU
text:
|Hello World
keys: g~iw
want:
|hELLO World

=== gUU upper-cases the line
text:
he|llo
keys: gUU
want:
|HELLO

=== guiw
text:
|ABC def
keys: guiw
want:
|abc def

=== J joins with a space
text:
|one
   two
keys: J
want:
one| two

=== r replaces characters
text:
|abc
keys: 2rx
want:
x|xc

=== ~ switches case and moves
text:
|abc
keys: ~~
want:
AB|c

=== an operator cancelled by Esc
text:
|abc
keys: d<Esc>x
want:
|bc

=== d with a search
text:
|one two three
keys: d/thr<CR>
want:
|three
